<title>USA: TENNIS-EVERT CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EVERT CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIAN WELLS, California 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $1.25 million Evert Cup women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Sunday (prefix number denotes seedings):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>2-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Petra Begerow (Germany) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>3-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Anna Kournikova (Russia) 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>5-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Asa Carlsson (Sweden) beat 10-Barbara Paulus (Austria) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>11-Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Barbara Rittner (Germany) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>14-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Elena Makarova (Russia)</p>
<p>6-2 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>15-Chanda Rubin (U.S.) beat Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) 7-5 2-6</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Venus Williams (U.S.) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 3-6 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
